// F2: union of a cylinder with a curved sweep whose end caps intersect the
// cylinder surface: "boolean union failed: SM_ERR_NULL_POINTER (1006)". If the
// ends lie deeper in the cylinder (r = 15 instead of 19), it works. In a union() { … } block
// the same message appears twice at 1:1 (duplicate diagnostic).
// Status (report 13): open (SMLib intersection cylinder/curved sweep near the end cap);
// the duplicate diagnostic is fixed (one message per failed operation).
// EXPECT: error-free
cylinder(h = 40, r = 20);
sweep(path = [[19, 0, 30], [35, 0, 25], [19, 0, 10]]) circle(3);
